### PhiraMpServer WebAPI Test Requests (多服务器支持)
### 确保先启动 PhiraMpServer 和 WebAPI 项目

# 选择你使用的配置文件（https 或 http）
# @baseUrl = https://localhost:7011
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5287

@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api

### ============================================
### SampleController Tests
### ============================================

### 1. GET - 获取基本信息和所有服务器连接状态
GET {{apiUrl}}/sample
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. GET by ID - 根据 ID 获取信息
GET {{apiUrl}}/sample/123
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. POST - 创建新资源
POST {{apiUrl}}/sample
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User"
}

###

### 4. PUT - 更新资源
PUT {{apiUrl}}/sample/456
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Name"
}

###

### 5. DELETE - 删除资源
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/sample/789
Accept: application/json

###

### ============================================
### ServerController - 服务器管理
### ============================================

### 6. GET - 获取所有服务器的连接状态
GET {{apiUrl}}/server/status
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. GET - 获取指定服务器的连接状态 (Server1)
GET {{apiUrl}}/server/Server1/status
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. GET - 获取指定服务器的连接状态 (Server2)
GET {{apiUrl}}/server/Server2/status
Accept: application/json

###

### 8.1 GET - 获取指定服务器的详细状态信息 (Server1)
GET {{apiUrl}}/server/Server1/details
Accept: application/json

###

### 8.2 GET - 获取指定服务器的详细状态信息 (Server2)
GET {{apiUrl}}/server/Server2/details
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. PUT - 设置 Server1 的全局房间最大玩家数
PUT {{apiUrl}}/server/Server1/maxplayers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxPlayers": 8
}

###

### 10. PUT - 设置 Server2 的全局房间最大玩家数
PUT {{apiUrl}}/server/Server2/maxplayers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxPlayers": 16
}

###

### 11. PUT - 设置所有服务器的全局房间最大玩家数
PUT {{apiUrl}}/server/maxplayers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxPlayers": 10
}

###

