### ============================================
### 错误处理测试
### ============================================

### 18. GET - 获取不存在的服务器的连接状态
GET {{apiUrl}}/server/NonExistentServer/status
Accept: application/json

###

### 19. GET - 获取不存在的服务器的房间信息
GET {{apiUrl}}/room/NonExistentServer
Accept: application/json

###

### 20. PUT - 设置无效的最大玩家数 (0)
PUT {{apiUrl}}/server/Server1/maxplayers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxPlayers": 0
}

###

### 21. PUT - 设置无效的最大玩家数 (负数)
PUT {{apiUrl}}/server/Server1/maxplayers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxPlayers": -1
}

###

### 22. 测试: 无效的 JSON 格式
PUT {{apiUrl}}/server/Server1/maxplayers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxPlayers": "not-a-number"
}

###

### 23. 测试: 缺少必需字段
PUT {{apiUrl}}/server/Server1/maxplayers
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

