### 综合测试场景
### ============================================

### 24. 测试流程: 检查所有服务器连接状态
GET {{apiUrl}}/server/status
Accept: application/json

### 25. 测试流程: 获取所有服务器的房间信息
GET {{apiUrl}}/room
Accept: application/json

### 26. 测试流程: 获取 Server1 的房间信息
GET {{apiUrl}}/room/Server1
Accept: application/json

### 27. 测试流程: 设置 Server1 的最大玩家数
PUT {{apiUrl}}/server/Server1/maxplayers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxPlayers": 12
}

### 28. 测试流程: 再次获取 Server1 的房间信息验证设置
GET {{apiUrl}}/room/Server1
Accept: application/json

###

