PUT {{apiUrl}}/server/Server1/maxplayers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxPlayers": 1
}

###

### 30. 边界测试: 设置较大的玩家数 (100)
PUT {{apiUrl}}/server/Server1/maxplayers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxPlayers": 100
}

###

### 31. 边界测试: 同时设置所有服务器的最大玩家数
PUT {{apiUrl}}/server/maxplayers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxPlayers": 20
}

###

